     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\"> Dear all</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\"> </span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">I have a couple of basic question on sliding semilandmarks. First, it is possible to slide semilandmarks using microscribe-derived coordinates using the morphologika format in Geomorph?  And second, how I can proceed?.</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\"><br></span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:start;margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\"> Here I attach an example file (skulls.txt) with 7 specimens and 114 landmarks from human skulls. I try to tell geomorph that I want 6 of those landmarks to be sliding semilandmarks.</span></font><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;text-align:start\"> <u></u><u></u></span></span></span><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\"> Here I don’t know if I need a .csv file indicating which are the sliding semilandmarks or if I can define those points directly in the R console. I use this function to define semilandmarks</span></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">define.sliders(x$coords, nsliders=6,\r\nsurfsliders=NULL)</font> but I get this error: <u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">Error in define.sliders(x$coords,\r\nnsliders = 6, surfsliders = NULL) : <u></u><u></u></font></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"> \r\n&#39;landmarks&#39; should be the shape matrix of a single specimen</font><u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"> According to this I used a file with just one individual to define sliders but a got a new error: <u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;text-align:justify;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:init